# Android-specific overrides on top of the monorepo .gitignore.
# The root .gitignore already covers `*.iml`, `*.apk`, `*.aab`, `*.aar`,
# `.gradle/`, `**/build/`, `captures/`, `.cxx/`. We just need the
# Android-SDK-relative bits that Gradle / AGP create on sync.

# Local SDK + API overrides — per-developer, never commit
local.properties

# Hilt + KSP generated code lives under build/; the build/ rule ignores it.
# Android Studio adds these:
.idea/
.kotlin/

# Native debug symbols from NDK (we don't use NDK yet, but cover the case)
**/externalNativeBuild/
**/.cxx/

# Test reports / coverage (some teams keep these; we don't)
**/reports/
**/coverage/

# Keystores (when we add release signing later)
*.jks
*.keystore
release/
